OL,3,A'Feudal' leasehold system set to be
OL,4,Ascrapped in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe legislation follows Labour's 2024
OL,7,Felection manifesto to "bring the feudal
OL,8,Fleasehold system to an end" - with
OL,9,Ffurther details expected to be set out
OL,10,Flater.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
