OL,3,AThis is a remarkable diplomatic moment
OL,4,Afor China's Xi - but it comes with
OL,5,Apitfalls
OL,6,
OL,7,FXi Jinping will believe he has achieved
OL,8,Fsomething no other world leader could
OL,9,Fin securing a historic summit with
OL,10,FVladimir Putin and Donald Trump in
OL,11,FShenzhen.
OL,13,FFor decades, Washington and its western
OL,14,Fallies shaped the world order.
OL,16,FYet it is China that has orchestrated
OL,17,Fthe remarkable diplomatic spectacle of
OL,18,Fthree of the world's most powerful
OL,19,Fprotagonists sitting around the table.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
