CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1795070872
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMyanmar faces historic genocide verdict
OL,4,Aat UN court over Rohingya massacres
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It would be a judgment of landmark
OL,7,Fimportance if The Gambia were to win
OL,8,Fthis case," says Arsalan Suleman, the
OL,9,Flawyer leading the case against Myanmar
OL,10,Fat the court. "It would give renewed
OL,11,Fvitality to the 1948 Genocide
OL,12,FConvention and to the notion of
OL,13,Finternational legal accountability for
OL,14,Fcrimes committed by a state."
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
